-- Loot: the Forever blues of the 5-player dungeon bosses in 2026_10_26_42 dropped at Wowhead Forever's raw rate (about 1-4% each).
-- That rate is diluted by kills from before Forever added the item, as 2026_10_26_51 found for the _50 drops, which it raised
-- to the rate of comparable vanilla drops. The same rule here, chance INFERRED:
--  * a boss with its own vanilla blues: the vMaNGOS per-item chance of those blues (the lowest of them, as in 26_51);
--  * a boss without them (the Stockade bosses, Lorgus Jett, Oggleflint, Bazzalan): 100 / the number of its Forever blues,
--    so on average one of them drops per kill;
--  * capped at 100 / the number of its Forever blues (Rethilgore and Aggem Thorncurse have one vanilla blue at 100%).
-- Spotted by Duy Hoang (dqhoang, advocaite/TrinityCore PRs #264 and #265: Forever boss sets that hardly ever dropped).
-- Each UPDATE only matches the row while it still has its Wowhead comment, so a later correction is kept and a second run changes nothing.
UPDATE `creature_loot_template` SET `Chance`=10, `Comment`='Sneed''s Shredder: Dull Sawblade (chance INFERRED, boss blues: own blues 10/90)' WHERE `Entry`=642 AND `ItemType`=0 AND `Item`=285292 AND `Comment` LIKE '%Wowhead Forever%';
